  "html": "<div id=\"step-e51600\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Identifying a Decimal Interval for a Root of an Integer</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e51600\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <p>Between which two consecutive tenths does <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.239ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.192ex\" height=\"2.398ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -954.5 1853 1060\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mroot\"><g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(853,0)\"><path data-c=\"37\" d=\"M55 458Q56 460 72 567L88 674Q88 676 108 676H128V672Q128 662 143 655T195 646T364 644H485V605L417 512Q408 500 387 472T360 435T339 403T319 367T305 330T292 284T284 230T278 162T275 80Q275 66 275 52T274 28V19Q270 2 255 -10T221 -22Q210 -22 200 -19T179 0T168 40Q168 198 265 368Q285 400 349 489L395 552H302Q128 552 119 546Q113 543 108 522T98 479L95 458V455H55V458Z\"></path><path data-c=\"35\" d=\"M164 157Q164 133 148 117T109 101H102Q148 22 224 22Q294 22 326 82Q345 115 345 210Q345 313 318 349Q292 382 260 382H254Q176 382 136 314Q132 307 129 306T114 304Q97 304 95 310Q93 314 93 485V614Q93 664 98 664Q100 666 102 666Q103 666 123 658T178 642T253 634Q324 634 389 662Q397 666 402 666Q410 666 410 648V635Q328 538 205 538Q174 538 149 544L139 546V374Q158 388 169 396T205 412T256 420Q337 420 393 355T449 201Q449 109 385 44T229 -22Q148 -22 99 32T50 154Q50 178 61 192T84 210T107 214Q132 214 148 197T164 157Z\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></path></g></g><g data-mml-node=